{"version":2,"slug":"slow-american-english-travel-vlog-chicago-part-3-improve-your-listening-reading","videoId":"mfZTkDKA60c","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/mfZTkDKA60c","lang":"en","title":"SLOW (American) English Travel Vlog | Chicago Part 3! Improve Your Listening & Reading Skills!","category":"Vlog","channel":"Speak English with Bo's Slow English","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"We are at Millennium"},{"start":3,"text":"Park, I think is what it's called."},{"start":6,"text":"Take a look at this cool art."},{"start":11,"text":"My dad wants to take a picture"},{"start":14,"text":"of us."},{"start":18,"text":"They must be cold."},{"start":28,"text":"The sunset is really beautiful,"},{"start":32,"text":"but I'm not able to capture it with the"},{"start":35,"text":"camera."},{"start":39,"text":"Too bad."},{"start":41,"text":"Now we're heading up towards the"},{"start":44,"text":"infamous"},{"start":46,"text":"silver bean thing"},{"start":50,"text":"sculpture."},{"start":52,"text":"There are a lot of tourists in this"},{"start":54,"text":"area."},{"start":56,"text":"Here we are."},{"start":58,"text":"My husband has been here before and he"},{"start":61,"text":"said when he came"},{"start":64,"text":"there were no tourists here."},{"start":67,"text":"Which is hard to believe because look at"},{"start":69,"text":"how many tourists there are."},{"start":72,"text":"He must have came really early in the"},{"start":75,"text":"morning."},{"start":77,"text":"We're going to walk up a little closer"},{"start":80,"text":"to the sculpture."},{"start":87,"text":"So cool."},{"start":91,"text":"Does anyone know"},{"start":93,"text":"what this venue is called?"},{"start":97,"text":"I did not see a sign."},{"start":100,"text":"But the architecture is"},{"start":104,"text":"fascinating."},{"start":107,"text":"It's fully made of steel."},{"start":110,"text":"Nice layout of the seats."},{"start":115,"text":"And they maintain the field really well."},{"start":120,"text":"Looks like there is"},{"start":122,"text":"an orchestra or band playing inside."},{"start":127,"text":"Here is another view of"},{"start":130,"text":"the bean structure."},{"start":132,"text":"Comment below"},{"start":134,"text":"and let me know"},{"start":136,"text":"when was the last time you went to a"},{"start":139,"text":"concert"},{"start":140,"text":"and which artist did you see? We found a"},{"start":146,"text":"walkway"},{"start":148,"text":"and I'm not sure where this is leading"},{"start":151,"text":"us to."},{"start":152,"text":"Let's see if this sign will tell us. I"},{"start":156,"text":"think this is just highlighting"},{"start":159,"text":"an artist."},{"start":161,"text":"So"},{"start":162,"text":"that's not it."},{"start":164,"text":"Ah, we must be at Lurie"},{"start":168,"text":"Garden."},{"start":172,"text":"Oh, this whole thing is a garden."},{"start":175,"text":"I guess we will follow my dad's lead."},{"start":181,"text":"It smells very clean here."},{"start":186,"text":"It doesn't smell polluted at all."},{"start":192,"text":"I wish I had a garden like this at my"},{"start":195,"text":"house."},{"start":198,"text":"Of all the things we could be looking at"},{"start":201,"text":"in this beautiful garden"},{"start":204,"text":"my dad wants to watch the traffic and"},{"start":210,"text":"the cops."},{"start":216,"text":"I am going to head back to the garden."},{"start":220,"text":"This is a bit more interesting for me."},{"start":224,"text":"What do you think?"},{"start":226,"text":"If you were"},{"start":228,"text":"to choose where to live"},{"start":232,"text":"would you prefer living in the mountain"},{"start":237,"text":"in the country"},{"start":240,"text":"by the beach"},{"start":243,"text":"in the desert?"},{"start":245,"text":"I would choose to be"},{"start":247,"text":"either in the country or in the mountain"},{"start":251,"text":"where it's quiet and secluded"},{"start":256,"text":"like this."},{"start":261,"text":"I could be here all day."},{"start":265,"text":"We are on a bridge"},{"start":269,"text":"and the security guard told us that"},{"start":273,"text":"there is another park up this way."},{"start":282,"text":"We are heading down this way"},{"start":287,"text":"to the park."},{"start":289,"text":"Chicago has"},{"start":291,"text":"really stunning architecture."},{"start":294,"text":"There is a"},{"start":296,"text":"rock climbing wall."},{"start":299,"text":"I used to love rock climbing when I was"},{"start":301,"text":"younger. I loved climbing on"},{"start":305,"text":"real rocks"},{"start":306,"text":"by the creek."},{"start":309,"text":"And I also used to belong to a rock"},{"start":313,"text":"climbing gym that had structures like"},{"start":316,"text":"this. I am so jealous"},{"start":320,"text":"that they are skating down there."},{"start":326,"text":"I want to be doing that. So I bet in the"},{"start":329,"text":"winter they turn this into an ice rink"},{"start":333,"text":"or maybe not because this is"},{"start":336,"text":"a little too steep"},{"start":338,"text":"to"},{"start":340,"text":"skate uphill"},{"start":342,"text":"on ice skates. This girl is on roller"},{"start":346,"text":"skates."},{"start":348,"text":"That guy"},{"start":349,"text":"is on roller blades."},{"start":353,"text":"Which do you prefer? My dad"},{"start":356,"text":"is loving all the"},{"start":359,"text":"lights, the nightlife"},{"start":363,"text":"in Chicago."},{"start":366,"text":"We are walking to dinner"},{"start":369,"text":"and my friend recommended that we eat at"},{"start":374,"text":"this ramen place. In Korean we don't"},{"start":378,"text":"call it ramen, it's ramyeon."},{"start":385,"text":"My mom said that ramen or ramyeon is my"},{"start":390,"text":"dad's favorite. He also just corrected"},{"start":393,"text":"me and said it's not ramen, it's"},{"start":396,"text":"ramyeon."},{"start":413,"text":"We had a nice walk or a nice stroll"},{"start":417,"text":"through the park and now we sat down for"},{"start":420,"text":"dinner. We are going to order ramen."},{"start":424,"text":"The restaurant is called Ramen San"},{"start":428,"text":"and"},{"start":430,"text":"I am going to order the beef pho buns"},{"start":435,"text":"and we all would like to eat on the"},{"start":438,"text":"healthier side"},{"start":440,"text":"so we're going to order the tan tan san"},{"start":444,"text":"vegetarian ramen. Hi."},{"start":448,"text":"No."},{"start":450,"text":"My parents were craving kimchi, of"},{"start":452,"text":"course. I'm always craving kimchi."},{"start":459,"text":"Mashisoyo?"},{"start":461,"text":"Okay, my dad approved of the kimchi so"},{"start":464,"text":"that's a big deal."},{"start":466,"text":"We also ordered"},{"start":468,"text":"beef pho"},{"start":470,"text":"buns."},{"start":479,"text":"They've never seen this before."},{"start":482,"text":"Kimchi mashisoyo?"},{"start":485,"text":"My mom approved as well."},{"start":488,"text":"We got the ramen."},{"start":491,"text":"Let's see how my dad likes it."},{"start":493,"text":"He can be a little particular."},{"start":498,"text":"Appa?"},{"start":500,"text":"Mashisoyo?"},{"start":504,"text":"He said it's all right."},{"start":506,"text":"It has scallions,"},{"start":509,"text":"tofu"},{"start":511,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":516,"text":"Bok choy"},{"start":518,"text":"mushrooms"},{"start":520,"text":"and of course the ramen noodles."}]}